function renderCompetitionCatalog() { const typeSelect=$("#competitionTypeSelect"),eventSelect=$("#competitionEventSelect"),divisionSelect=$("#competitionDivisionSelect"),eventInput=$("#competitionEventNameInput"),divisionInput=$("#competitionDivisionNameInput");if(!typeSelect||!eventSelect||!divisionSelect)return;const type=typeSelect.value||"water",events=state.competitionEvents.filter(e=>catalogCompetitionType(e.competition_event_id)===type),divisions=state.competitionDivisions.filter(d=>catalogCompetitionType(d.competition_division_id)===type&&d.competition_division_id!=="division-indoor-unspecified");eventSelect.innerHTML='<option value="" selected disabled>종목 선택</option><option value="__new__">새 종목 등록</option>'+events.map(e=>`<option value="${esc(e.competition_event_id)}">${esc(e.competition_event_name)}</option>`).join("");divisionSelect.innerHTML='<option value="" selected disabled>나이대 선택</option><option value="__new__">새 나이대 등록</option>'+divisions.map(d=>`<option value="${esc(d.competition_division_id)}">${esc(d.competition_division_name)}</option>`).join("");eventInput.value="";eventInput.readOnly=true;divisionInput.value="";divisionInput.readOnly=true;const defaultEvent=type==="water"?events.find(event=>event.competition_event_name.trim()==="4X+"):type==="indoor"&&events.length===1?events[0]:null;if(defaultEvent){eventSelect.value=defaultEvent.competition_event_id;eventInput.value=defaultEvent.competition_event_name;}if(type==="beach"&&divisions.length===1){divisionSelect.value=divisions[0].competition_division_id;divisionInput.value=divisions[0].competition_division_name;}syncDropdownTriggers(); }
